Subject: [PATCH 07/29] Restore classify() and the shutdown-reason table

The previous edit replaced a range that ran past the end of lastShutdownReason
and took classify() with it, and the table's anchor was a KDoc rather than the
one-line comment it was written for, so the table was never inserted. Both
restored. getprop now waits one second rather than three: it runs on the main
thread inside Application.onCreate.

Co-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>
